 602:dependencies/DaisySeedGFX2/cDisplay.cpp **** // Add a block to the FIFO for transmission
 603:dependencies/DaisySeedGFX2/cDisplay.cpp **** // This function prepares a display block (defined by its coordinates) for 
 604:dependencies/DaisySeedGFX2/cDisplay.cpp **** // transmission to the screen and places it in the FIFO queue.
